afternoon an expert panel gave the fda a  green light to authorize emergency use  of pfizer's covet vaccine for kids ages  5 to 11. pfizer says its two-shot  low-dose vaccine is almost 91 percent  effective in that age group an fda  official told the panel young kids have  not been spared from illness or  hospitalization from covet and there  have also been close to 100 deaths  making it one of the top 10 causes of  death in this age range during this time  final approval from the cdc could come  as early as next week
 

